<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala Corp B up 8 pct at 27 pesos.</title>
<headline>Ayala Corp B up 8 pct at 27 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine conglomerate Ayala Corp B shares rose two pesos, or 8 percent, to 27 pesos by midsession on mild bargain-hunting, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The shares have been lagging behind the market. It's a bargain at this level,&quot; Noel Reyes, research head of Anscor Hagedorn Securities, said.</p>
<p>Overall trading volumes in the market were low, brokers said.</p>
</text>
